{"id": "main_01", "category": "main", "text": "帮忙看下 A站 到 B站，两头用 XX-100，工作在 2 GHz。余量得有 10 dB，够用吗？不够要把发射功率加到多少才够？", "expected": {"status": "completed", "target": "link_margin", "requirement": {"quantity": "link_margin_db", "op": ">=", "value": 10}, "solve": "tx_power_dbm", "sites": ["site:sim-a", "site:sim-b"], "device": "device:sim-xx100", "margin_db": 5.93339058585, "power_dbm": 41.06660941415, "tolerance": 1e-06, "exceeds_rated": true}}
